[ti:Siempre Me Encuentras (You Find Me)]
[ar:Evan Craft]
[al:Desesperado (English)]

[00:05.40]You are the light in the dark
[00:07.32]When I cannot see
[00:08.99]You open up my eyes
[00:11.06]Cuando el camino está duro
[00:13.02]Sé que está bien
[00:14.13]It will still be alright
[00:17.05]Estás conmigo
[00:18.30]You are with me
[00:19.71]Sé que nunca me dejas
[00:22.34]No temeré
[00:23.60]I'll be okay
[00:25.24]De mí, tú no te alejas
[00:27.42]When I'm deep in the water
[00:29.17]With nothing but trust
[00:30.91]Siempre me encuentras
[00:33.33]You promise that you are enough
[00:35.33]No hay vuelta pa' atrás
[00:36.93]I'm safe in your love
[00:38.51]I know you will never let me go
[00:41.74]Y seguro estoy en tu amor
[00:44.58]You are more than enough
[00:46.40]There's no turning back
